Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就独自一人开过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll drive all the way there alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独自一人选辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick the car up alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再独自一人开回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drive all the way back alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:23.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要自己做午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to make my own lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了  我心都碎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, stop it, you're breaking my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是艾什  我太忙或者太懒  接不了电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, this is Ash. I'm too busy or lazy to answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留言吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so leave your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:53.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有客户序列号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a customer reference number?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有  我就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't, no. I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客户姓名呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What name is it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯达莫  艾什·斯达莫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... Starmer. Ash Starmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车还没还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not been returned yet, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两点前应该还的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's meant to be back by two, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.44,0:08:21.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们关门了  打过去也没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're closed now, no point calling back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.84,0:08:23.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的手机直接转接到语音信箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his just goes straight to messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些手机电池太烂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those batteries are a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定很快就回来  也许就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be on his way. He's probably just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕他是出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just scared something's happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But something could've happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, look, sweetheart, nothing's happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.70,0:08:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你在瞎操心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're just working yourself up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,净往坏处想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}imagining the worst possible thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许他只是在一个没信号的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's just, he's probably stuck somewhere with no reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不真实  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not real, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给马克守丧时  我也觉得这都不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At Mark's wake, I sat there thinking it's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人看起来不真实  声音也不真实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The people didn't look real, their voices weren't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:34.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像你在太空漫步  没人能...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like you're out on a spacewalk and no-one can...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.63,0:09:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以替你报名加入一个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can sign you up to something that helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.09,0:09:50.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时让我好受许多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你跟他对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will let you speak to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他死了  正是这样才有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he's dead, but it wouldn't work if he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  不是什么神神怪怪的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't worry, it's not some crazy spiritual thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.13,0:10:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他严重依赖网络  所以会很完美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a heavy user, he'd be perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前还在测试阶段  但我有邀请码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's still in beta, but I've got an invite...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不用做  我帮你注册就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't have to do anything, I'll just sign you up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(艾什的身高记录)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.87,0:11:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管它是什么  我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what it is, I don't want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然用他的名字  真可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's obscene to use his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的名字啊  老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这让人心痛  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hurts, you know it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.17,0:12:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才帮你注册了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is why I signed you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么  到底是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.95,0:12:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你点击链接  跟它交谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You click the link and you talk to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它交谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像发邮件一样  输入信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You type messages in, like an e-mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.38,0:12:12.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就会向他生前那样  跟你对话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then it talks back to you, just like he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个软件  能模仿他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's software. It mimics him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:17.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你告诉它名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give it someone's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它就会读取这个人在网络上所有的公开言论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It goes back and reads through all the things they've ever said online,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.41,0:12:25.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括facebook和推特上的发言  等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their Facebook updates, their Tweets, anything public.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我输入艾什的名字  其他都由系统代办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just gave it Ash's name. The system did the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.83,0:12:29.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.57,0:12:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做很恶心  恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's...sick. It's sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟它打个招呼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say hello to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让它访问艾什的私人邮箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you then give it access to his private emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它知道的越多  模仿得越像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more it has, the more it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.95,0:12:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.46,0:12:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  它不是  但能好受些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not, but it helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奈  你好  是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Nay, it's me. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really need to speak to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到留言能打给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you please call me as soon as you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉  我才听到留言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry. I just got your message.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:18.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  发生了什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mar?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:22.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛  你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mar, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.75,0:16:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事没事  只是...之前吐得很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah, I'm fine, I just, I just... I had a bad one earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.40,0:16:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要我去看看你  我过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D'you want me to come and visit? I'm going to come and visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.26,0:16:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了  真的没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's OK, really, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛  你很低落  我去看看你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mar, you're upset. I'm going to come and see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  别来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.57,0:16:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好  我保证我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK. I promise you I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.17,0:16:41.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得挂了  要赶工期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go, I've got a deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工期很紧  要在天亮前交稿  我得挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a tight deadline, got to be in by dawn, so... I'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.45,0:16:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见  奈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.22,0:17:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨  我又被自己锁在门外了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, I've locked myself out of the house again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  你要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.62,0:17:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一向不擅长挑生日礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. I'm no good at birthday presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我爱你 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I love you... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:11.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.82,0:18:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听起来怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I sounding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.57,0:18:18.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来真和他一模一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点吓人是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost creepy isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.76,0:18:25.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说"吓人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say creepy,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是说我竟然能跟你通话  太神奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's totally batshit crazy I can even talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都没有嘴巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I don't even have a mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那...那就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's... that's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他会说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just the sort of thing that he would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.87,0:18:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我也不会那么说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's why I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是要疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm going mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.02,0:18:55.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不说我也不说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't tell anyone if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.44,0:19:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会是在哭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not crying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.33,0:19:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总说我哭的样子很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You always said that I looked weird when I cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.93,0:19:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听起来真像个混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sound like a right sick fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.47,0:19:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you were. You were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.94,0:19:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过是好的那种  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in a good way?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:27.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错  是好的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah. In a good way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:36.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经过你的一番劝说  我跳进了海里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I went in, after all your persuasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:38.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但几乎马上就被\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then like straightaway I got
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海葵还是什么的扎到脚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a spine of a sea anemone or something stuck in my foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:45.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为那东西是有毒的  吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you threw a jeb thinking it was poisonous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫"吓坏了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's "threw a jeb"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是个说法  意思是"懊恼"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's um, it's a phrase we had, like throwing a fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我当时"吓坏了"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, OK, so I "threw a jeb".
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.66,0:19:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你就翻旅行手册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you were looking in a guidebook,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.31,0:19:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看看希腊有没有毒性的海洋生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to figure out if there were any poisonous sea creatures in Greece,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时走来一个当地居民  对我们说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when this local guy comes over and says,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.19,0:20:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我太太知道该怎么处理  来我家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My wife knows exactly what to do, come back to my house."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.15,0:20:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  显然他不是法国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although he wasn't French, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.13,0:20:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前讨厌在乡间散步的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to hate walking in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.66,0:20:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你肯定是老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.37,0:20:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.02,0:20:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还记得我们第一次见你妈时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember you brought me up here when we
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带我来这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}first met your mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.23,0:20:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们整个周末都住在她家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd been at hers all weekend
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.39,0:20:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看得出我需要静一静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you could tell I needed some headspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很贴心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were good like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说得好像我不在这儿似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak about me like I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:34.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  我的确不在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. I mean, I'm not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.77,0:20:42.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看那里什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me what it looks like there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用手机拍一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use the camera on your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对美景一向无动于衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You weren't ever really impressed with views.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去科罗拉多大峡谷的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we went to the Grand Canyon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.29,0:20:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说那只是个大沟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you said it was just a big gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.70,0:20:57.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还发到推特上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Tweeted that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我还记得当时的漫游费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I remember the roaming charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:02.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还觉得那么说很有才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were overly proud of that definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.48,0:21:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么想就怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just speaking my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  别说了  看看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well shut up and cop a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了  就是一片绿色  是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Mainly just green, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:13.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说这是个有名的殉情之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me this was a famous lover's leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.13,0:21:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维多利亚时期  绝望的恋人到这里跳崖自尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doomed couples jumping to their deaths in Victorian times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你这么说  只是想让我靠紧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you just wanted me to cling to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.78,0:21:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  来这里跳崖的都是一个人  真不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually everyone who's ever jumped from here did it alone. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是刚查到的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just look that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧  不该这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of. Shouldn't I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bit weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我不会再这样了  除非你想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I'll only do it again if you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  有电话来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wait, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.46,0:21:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不我挂了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不用  我过后再回他们电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. I'll call them back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看能不能和这些奶牛做个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to go and see if I can make friends with these cows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.83,0:22:11.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我录一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just going to record it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.28,0:22:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己来就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.71,0:22:31.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下  我再放一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, hang on, here it is again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:37.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳得真快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so fast, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.11,0:22:39.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这速度就像蜜蜂还是什么的心跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's like the speed you'd expect a bee's heart to go at or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:44.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼  完了  完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit. Shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:54.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什  喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.70,0:22:57.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.23,0:23:03.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什  听得到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ash? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.05,0:23:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.36,0:23:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.45,0:23:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把你摔地上了  真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dropped you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.35,0:23:32.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在是...真对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just... It was... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.36,0:23:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系  我没事  我又不在那里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, it's all right, I'm fine. I'm not in that thing, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.23,0:23:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是远程控制的  在天上呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm remote, I'm in the cloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.75,0:23:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用担心会把我弄坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to worry about breaking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.59,0:23:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时太傻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just, it was stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B超让我太激动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I was so excited about the scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:46.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  那声音我存着呢  你听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I kept the sound of that. Here, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.06,0:23:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时心跳应该能赶上这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were probably matching that heartbeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.88,0:23:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也吓坏了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throwing a jeb like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.84,0:23:59.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all fine. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.81,0:24:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会丢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.09,0:24:07.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very fragile.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.46,0:24:12.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  我正想和你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I was going to talk to you about that, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.19,0:24:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说吧  这服务还有更高级的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's another level to this available, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.17,0:24:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在试验阶段  而且说实话  挺贵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of experimental, and I won't lie, it's not cheap...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.06,0:24:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.37,0:24:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在坐着吗  听起来会有点恐怖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sitting down? This might sound a bit creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.50,0:24:39.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
