Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.62,0:41:51.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,档案馆里有很多恶言谩骂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's tons of invective in the archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.33,0:41:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是有话直说  我可以对你说一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like speaking my mind, I could throw some of that at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.09,0:41:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.59,0:42:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能走出我启动点25米开外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go more than 25 metres from my activation point.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.64,0:42:35.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that, a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.10,0:42:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这很疯狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know it sounds mental.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.27,0:42:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的启动点在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your activation point?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.84,0:42:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这可能会让你疯掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the risk of blowing your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.82,0:42:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是我启动的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's where I was activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.13,0:42:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是浴缸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.02,0:42:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须待在浴缸25米半径内  除非我的管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to keep within a 25-metre radius unless my administrator,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.53,0:42:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你  陪着我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's you, is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.97,0:42:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说我是你的管理员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't call me your administrator.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.66,0:42:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.67,0:42:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.33,0:42:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听上去挺性感的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sounds sort of sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.06,0:43:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你笑了  我能回去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're laughing, can I come back inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.22,0:43:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.67,0:43:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己像株观赏植物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ornamental out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.02,0:43:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能把那个放下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you put that down, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.18,0:43:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是很好笑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.73,0:43:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个放下好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you just put it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.00,0:43:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来  我们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me. We're going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.61,0:43:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.59,0:44:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.75,0:44:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.24,0:44:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.46,0:44:33.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.09,0:44:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.52,0:44:41.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  别那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.63,0:44:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.81,0:44:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.89,0:44:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧  他会知道到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, he would have worked out what was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.57,0:44:52.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我不会这样做  但是如果有这个情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This wouldn't have ever happened, but if it had,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.27,0:44:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would have worked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.67,0:44:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  等等  这句话不太好理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, hang on. That's a very difficult sentence to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.64,0:44:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.08,0:45:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  往那儿跳吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.46,0:45:06.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没有任何自杀或自残倾向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never expressed suicidal thoughts, or self-harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.51,0:45:08.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, you aren't you, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.22,0:45:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句也不太好理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's another difficult one, to be honest with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.55,0:45:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是你的涟漪  你没有过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just a few ripples of you. There's no history to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.71,0:45:18.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是表演了他未经思考做的一些事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just a performance of stuff that he performed without thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.87,0:45:20.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是不够的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.44,0:45:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样  我是来取悦你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. I aim to please.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.16,0:45:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就跳吧  跳吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aim to jump. Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.83,0:45:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're absolutely sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.30,0:45:32.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞧  艾什会害怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, Ash would've been scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.23,0:45:33.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会就那么跳了  他会哭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wouldn't have just leapt off, he would have been crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.98,0:45:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.48,0:45:40.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh... Oh, God, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.68,0:45:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你  我不想那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I don't want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.31,0:45:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你别逼我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't make me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.67,0:45:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.26,0:45:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我很害怕  亲爱的  求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm... I'm frightened, darling, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.59,0:45:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.56,0:45:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想死啊  天呐  我不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to die. Oh, God, I don't want to die
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.54,0:45:55.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.82,0:45:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好怕  我不想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm frightened, I don't want to die. Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.90,0:46:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.04,0:46:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一块给你  一块给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One for you, one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.09,0:46:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.28,0:46:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还得要一片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need another slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.68,0:46:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.68,0:46:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好拿上去啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I can take one upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.60,0:46:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又没到周末\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.23,0:46:32.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我生日嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.90,0:46:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.67,0:46:44.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Thanks, Mum."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.86,0:46:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾什\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.89,0:46:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小寿星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. The birthday girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.29,0:46:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来跟你待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just gonna come and hang out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.96,0:46:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  反正我也没做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. I wasn't doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.71,0:47:01.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你拿蛋糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought you some cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.29,0:47:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你不吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you don't eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.13,0:47:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我就是用你做借口想多吃一块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just using you as an excuse so I can get an extra slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.04,0:47:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真坏啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devious.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.62,0:47:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.75,0:47:10.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.65,0:47:15.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm just coming.
